  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Passive Houses for Moldova (PH4M)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Passive Houses for Moldova (PH4M) is part of the broader Energy Efficiency and Renewable Energies in the Republic of Moldova (E4M) program. The Danish support for PH4M will help establish a new funding scheme focused on both renovating existing family houses and constructing new energy-efficient, low-carbon homes (near zero energy buildings &#x2013; NZEB). In addition, the project aims to strengthen Moldova&#x2019;s policies and legislation on energy-efficient housing, enhance capacity through training, and raise public awareness through information campaigns.</narrative>
  </description>
